<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Randgold Q1 pre-capex net profit plunges.</title>
<headline>Randgold Q1 pre-capex net profit plunges.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-March versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Net profit before capital spending  54.99 vs 128.79</p>
<p>    Capital spending			  46.56 vs  45.09</p>
<p>    Tax					   22.39 vs  26.74</p>
<p>Full name: Gold mines managed by Randgold and Exploration Co Ltd  </p>
<p>NOTE - Randgold said the fall in the gold price had taken a heavy toll in the quarter. Total cash operating profit for its mines amounted to 53.4 million rand in the period but the figure would have been 110.8 million had the average gold price for the previous quarter applied.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
